## Skills available

- **`/checkpoint`** — mid-session state snapshot to `~/.claude/checkpoints/<repo>/`. Use every ~50 turns in long sessions.
- **`/brief`** — expand a one-line task into the full briefing template. Use at the start of non-trivial work.
- **`/spec`** — interview-driven SPEC.md for ambiguous features. Hands off to a fresh session for execution.
- **`/review`** — spawn a fresh-context reviewer subagent against a recent change. Writer/reviewer pattern from multi-agent research.
- **`/recall`** — retrieve past session context from `~/.claude/checkpoints/`. Use at the start of a fresh session in any repo where you've previously taken checkpoints.

---

## File locations

- Checkpoints: `~/.claude/checkpoints/<repo>/`
- Skills: `~/.claude/skills/<name>/SKILL.md`
- Hooks: `~/.claude/hooks/<name>.sh` (registered in `~/.claude/settings.json`)
